    "plateBody": "Twelve slots sit under a fixed top pointer. Pick exactly one slot. Exact land only wins. Returns: 1–4 x2, 5–7 x3, 8–9 x4, 10 x5, 11 x7, 12 x10. Icons: Clover through Jackpot. Settlement is server-authoritative; visuals only reveal."
